# 나쁜 예 (교육용) — 한 셀에 GAFF2(12-6) 톨루엔 + COMPASS(9-6) 물 + Buckingham 광물을 hybrid 로 겹치고 축소 계수도 둘
units          real
atom_style     full
boundary       p p f
pair_style     hybrid lj/cut/coul/long 12.0 lj/class2/coul/long 12.0 buck/coul/long 12.0
pair_modify    mix arithmetic
pair_modify    mix sixthpower
kspace_style   pppm 1.0e-4
special_bonds  lj 0.0 0.0 0.5 coul 0.0 0.0 0.833333
special_bonds  lj/coul 0.0 0.0 1.0
read_data      mixed.data
pair_coeff     * * coul/long
pair_coeff     1*4 1*4 lj/cut/coul/long
pair_coeff     5*6 5*6 lj/class2/coul/long
pair_coeff     7*8 7*8 buck/coul/long 1388.77 0.3623 175.0
run            100
